      "html": "<div id=\"question-134232\" class=\"question\">                                \n                        <div id=\"question-134232-text\" class=\"questionText\">      \n                            \n                            <!--<span style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;\">b.</span>-->\n\n                            <div id=\"question-134232-graphic\" class=\"questionGraphic\">\n                                \n                            </div>   \n\n\n                            Carla has <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> packages of almonds, each weighing <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> ounces. In total, Carla has<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"6\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        <div class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" style=\"min-width: 30px; margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px;\">\n                                             \n                                        <div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"3\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"21\">5</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"23\">0</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"25\">4</span></span></div></div>                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"7\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>ounces of almonds.\n\n                                    \n                                 \n\n                                \n\n                                                      \n                        </div>  \n\n                        \n\n                        <div class=\"submitButtonFrame\">                     \n                            <div id=\"submitButton-3\" class=\"submitButton enabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div>                            \n                        </div>  \n                  \n                        <div class=\"spinnerFrame\">\n                            <img id=\"spinner-3\" class=\"spinner\" src=\"/img/spinner.gif\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div id=\"question-134232-explanationFrame\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                               \n                        <div class=\"answer\">\n                <table>\n                    <tbody><tr>\n                        <td><img class=\"answerSymbol\" src=\"/img/green-checkmark.png\"></td>\n                        <td class=\"correctAnswerText\">Correct</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody></table></div><div class=\"explanationHeader\">Explanation</div><div class=\"questionExplanation\"><p>To calculate the total amount of almonds, we need to multiply <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"31\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"32\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So, we write it this way:</p>\n<p